        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential is proud to present 22 The Walk to the Dublin 15 property market.\r\n\r\nThis exceptional three-bedroom, three-bathroom home comes to the market in true turnkey condition, having been lovingly maintained and upgraded by its current owners. Offering bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout, this A-rated property is ready for immediate occupation and will appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers, and investors alike.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a spacious living room, a modern kitchen/dining area, a separate utility room, and a guest WC. Upstairs, there are three generous bedrooms, with the principal bedroom benefiting from an en-suite, along with a family bathroom completing the accommodation.\r\n\r\nA standout feature of this home is the spacious rear garden, providing an ideal setting for outdoor entertaining, family gatherings, or weekend barbecues. To the front, the property benefits from private off-street parking.\r\n\r\nThe location is highly convenient, with Dublin Airport approximately 20 minutes away by car. Clonee, Dunboyne, Clonsilla, and Blanchardstown Villages are all within easy reach, while Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is also conveniently close by. The area boasts an excellent range of recreational and sporting amenities, including the National Aquatic Centre and Sport Ireland Campus.\r\n\r\nDublin 15's major corporate parks and Connolly Hospital are also nearby, while both the Phoenix Park and Castleknock Village can be reached within approximately 15 minutes. The property is within easy reach of a number of primary and secondary schools, making it particularly attractive to families.\r\n\r\nExcellent public transport links provide easy access to Dublin City Centre, while the nearby M50, M3, and M2 motorways ensure convenient connectivity to the wider Dublin region and beyond.\r\n\r\nThis is a superb opportunity to acquire a beautifully presented, energy-efficient home in a well-connected residential location in Dublin 15.\r\n\r\n\r\n***Disclaimer:***\r\n*All details are provided to the best of our knowledge. While we strive for accuracy, some information may have been provided by the vendor. We are not liable for any mistakes, errors, or inaccuracies in our online advertising, and we advise all interested parties to seek professional advice regarding any concerns.*"
